  {
   "section": "manage-your-risk",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Manage Your Risk"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Diet The food you eat plays a vital role in cancer prevention. Learn how to create a healthy diet with our dietitians’ tips.",
     "href": "https://www.mdanderson.org/prevention-screening/manage-your-risk/diet.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Body Weight Maintaining a healthy body weight lowers your risk for 13 types of cancer. Learn how to get to a healthy weight.",
     "href": "https://www.mdanderson.org/prevention-screening/manage-your-risk/body-weight.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Physical Activity By increasing your physical activity, you can lower your risk of many types of cancers.",
     "href": "https://www.mdanderson.org/prevention-screening/manage-your-risk/physical-activity.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "HPV Almost everyone will get the human papillomavirus (HPV) in their lifetime. HPV causes almost all cervical cancers.",
     "href": "https://www.mdanderson.org/prevention-screening/manage-your-risk/hpv.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Hepatitis Hepatitis is a leading cause of liver cancer. Learn about the risks, screening and how to protect yourself.",
     "href": "https://www.mdanderson.org/prevention-screening/manage-your-risk/hepatitis.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Smoking and tobacco Smoking and tobacco use raises your cancer risk. Learn how to quit and get tips to avoid secondhand smoke.",
     "href": "https://www.mdanderson.org/prevention-screening/manage-your-risk/tobacco-control-at-md-anderson/smoking-tobacco.html"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Skin safety Being smart about exposure to UV rays from the sun and tanning beds can help you prevent skin cancer.",
     "href": "https://www.mdanderson.org/prevention-screening/manage-your-risk/skin-safety.html"
    }
   ],
